  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given :-**\n\n**(1)/({1.4)} + (1)/({4.7)} + (1)/({7.10)} + ... + (1)/({47.50)}.**\n\n**Calculation :-**\n\n(1)/({1.4)} + (1)/({4.7)} + (1)/({7.10)} + ... + (1)/({47.50)}.\n\nwe multiply by 3 both numerator and denominator\n\n(1)/(3)[(3)/({1.4)} + (3)/({4.7)} + (3)/({7.10)} + ... + (3)/({47.50)}.]\n\nNow,\n\n1/3[1 - 1/4 + 1/4 - 1/7 + 1/7 - 1/10 + ....... + 1/47 - 1/50 ]\n\n1/3[ 1 - 1/50 ]\n\n1/3 × 49/50 = **49/150**",
